<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
<p>ToolStack Lab is reader-supported. Some links on this site are affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission if you buy through them — at no additional cost to you.</p>
<h2>What that changes, and what it does not</h2>
<p>It does not change the verdict. Tools are ranked on test results, and a tool with no affiliate program can and does win a comparison. Every review documents at least one real downside, whether or not the tool pays a commission.</p>
<h2>Where disclosure appears</h2>
<p>Any article containing affiliate links carries a disclosure notice above the content, in line with the U.S. FTC Endorsement Guides.</p>
